extDescription:
Activate 1 of these effects;
<br>• If you control an "Odd-Eyes" card: Target 1 card on the field; destroy it.
<br>• Add to your hand, 1 Level 7 "Odd-Eyes" monster from your Deck, or 1 face-up Level 7 "Odd-Eyes" Pendulum Monster from your Extra Deck.

